{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Body measurements and quality of life of X-Fittt 2.0 participants"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:242175"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"L.S. Mulderij"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wageningen University & Research"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"ORCID"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"0000-0003-2845-8745"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data  Librarian"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wageningen UR"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Care–physical activity (care–PA) initiatives may improve participants’ lifestyles and thereby lower overweight and obesity rates. X-Fittt 2.0 is a two-year care–PA initiative specifically developed for citizens with a low socioeconomic status, consisting of 2 phases: 12 weeks of intensive guidance and sports sessions and 21 months of aftercare. Body measurements (1) and questionnaires (2) (taken at start and 3 months, 1 year and 2 years after the start) were used to study the impact of X-Fittt 2.0 on health, quality of life and societal participation using a mixed-methods design.<br>(1) Body measurements included: Height, body weight, body mass index (BMI), fat percentage, waist circumference, blood pressure<br>(2) Questionnaire included: Quality of life score and self-perceived health (EQ-5D-3L and EQ-VAS), illness and medicine use, visits to healthcare professionals, monitoring of physical activity, societal participation (USER-P), smoking and alcohol behaviour, demographic information<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","English"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2022-04-12"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorType":{"typeName":"contributorType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Other"},"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A. Wagemakers (Wageningen University & Research)"}},{"contributorType":{"typeName":"contributorType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Other"},"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"K.T. Verkooijen (Wageningen University & Research)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"distributorName":{"typeName":"distributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wageningen University & Research"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2022-04-12"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2022-04-12"}]},"dansRights":{"